				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				172,
				2
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Output): Expand CopyVSRootFiles candidate resolution\n\nThe plugin now checks both `<root>/<file>` and `<root>/vs/<file>` for every location because nls.* files and other VS Code outputs live at different paths depending on which TSC pass produced them - some at the root, some under `vs/`.\n\nAlso adds proper NODE_ENV-aware ordering: production builds prioritize `out-build/` (release TSC flat layout) before `out/` (debug TSC source layout), while development builds do the reverse. An `OnDevelopment` override parameter allows tests to force the ordering.\n\nThe inline stub fallback for missing NLS files (tier 4) is preserved - stock VS Code generates `nls.messages.js` only during localization which our pipeline doesn't run.",
			"SHA": "36ce8f4a8863e03d3688d0cd644855cb6fdacfbc"
		}
	],
